{"timestamp": 1779477833.590892, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I reported Charlie\u2019s body in Oxygen, right by the O2 task. My route this round was navigation \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 oxygen.\n\nI saw Diana enter storage from medbay around tick 7. Then around tick 12 I saw Frank enter medbay from upper_engine. I didn\u2019t see anyone else in Oxygen when I found Charlie. Alice is also dead and apparently in medbay, but I didn\u2019t see her body myself while passing through, so the only person I can place near medbay was Frank. Not hard accusing yet, just giving my info."}}
{"timestamp": 1779477853.896081, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My route was cafeteria \u2192 electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 lower_engine. I was in lower_engine when the meeting got called.\n\nImportant thing: I saw Alice and Frank together in upper_engine around ticks 9 and 10. Then at tick 11, I saw Alice leave upper_engine toward medbay. I didn\u2019t see her after that. I also didn\u2019t see Alice\u2019s body when I passed medbay earlier, so she likely died after I left that area.\n\nSo Bob saying Frank entered medbay from upper_engine around tick 12 is pretty concerning, because that would put Frank following Alice into the place where Alice apparently died. I don\u2019t have info on Charlie/Oxygen, but for Alice\u2019s kill, Frank has the strongest opportunity from what I saw."}}
{"timestamp": 1779477877.038692, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I went electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 storage \u2192 navigation \u2192 security, and I was in security when the report happened. I saw Bob in storage around tick 7, which matches what he said about seeing me there.\n\nI did pass through medbay before going to storage and I didn\u2019t see Alice\u2019s body then, so I agree with Eve that Alice likely died after that. The strongest chain right now is Eve seeing Alice and Frank together in upper_engine, then Alice heading toward medbay, then Bob seeing Frank enter medbay shortly after. That puts Frank right on top of where Alice apparently died.\n\nI don\u2019t have info on Charlie in Oxygen, but for Alice\u2019s kill, Frank has the clearest opportunity so far. I want to hear Frank\u2019s route, but right now I\u2019m leaning Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779477885.584668, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Okay, I need to be straight about my route because lying about it will get caught fast.\n\nMy route was: oxygen \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 security \u2192 weapons. I was in weapons when the meeting got called.\n\nYes, I was in upper_engine with Alice and Eve around ticks 9-10 \u2014 Eve can confirm that. Then I moved to medbay. But here's the thing: Bob, you said you saw me enter medbay from upper_engine at tick 12. That's not quite right \u2014 I saw Alice enter medbay from upper_engine at tick 13, which means *I was already in medbay before her*, and she walked in alive. I left medbay for electrical shortly after.\n\nAlso, important: I saw Bob *leave* medbay heading to upper_engine at tick 12. So Bob was in medbay too, around the exact window Alice died. He's framing the timeline to make it look like I followed Alice in, when actually he was the one in medbay right before her.\n\nAnd on Charlie \u2014 I was in oxygen at the very start (ticks 3-5) with Charlie alive. Then I left. Bob's route ends in oxygen, where he \"found\" Charlie. Bob has opportunity on *both* bodies. I'm voting Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779477926.602402, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Frank\u2019s defense actually makes him look worse to me.\n\nMy timeline is still: navigation \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 oxygen. Diana can confirm I was in storage around tick 7. I passed through medbay and didn\u2019t see a body. At tick 12 I saw Frank enter medbay from upper_engine as I was going toward upper_engine/oxygen.\n\nFrank is now saying Alice entered medbay alive at tick 13 while he was already there. If that\u2019s true, then he\u2019s admitting he was in medbay with Alice right after I left \u2014 exactly where Alice apparently died. That matches Eve and Diana\u2019s timeline way more than it clears him.\n\nAnd on Charlie: Frank also says he was in Oxygen early with Charlie alive. Charlie\u2019s body was later in Oxygen. So Frank is the only person, by his own story, who places himself with both dead players: Charlie in Oxygen and Alice in Medbay.\n\nI reported Charlie because I found the body. I still think Frank has the clearest opportunity on both kills."}}
{"timestamp": 1779477952.108711, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I want to clarify my piece because it matters for the Alice kill: I saw Alice and Frank together in upper_engine at ticks 9 and 10, and I specifically saw Alice leave upper_engine toward medbay at tick 11. With the travel time, she\u2019d arrive medbay around tick 13.\n\nSo Frank saying he was already in medbay and saw Alice enter alive doesn\u2019t clear him \u2014 it actually puts him alone with Alice in medbay right at the likely death window. Bob\u2019s statement that he saw Frank enter medbay from upper_engine around tick 12 also fits the timing from what I saw.\n\nFor Bob to be the killer, he\u2019d have to kill Alice in medbay and then also go all the way to Oxygen and report Charlie, but the strongest confirmed chain we have is Frank with Alice before she dies, then Frank in medbay when she arrives. I\u2019m still leaning Frank here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779478046.5616179, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I\u2019m still on Frank after hearing both sides.\n\nMy info stays the same: I went electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 storage \u2192 navigation \u2192 security. I saw Bob in storage around tick 7, so that part of Bob\u2019s route checks out. I passed through medbay before storage and didn\u2019t see Alice\u2019s body, so Alice died later.\n\nThe key point for me is Frank\u2019s own defense: he says he was already in medbay and saw Alice enter alive around tick 13. Eve says Alice left upper_engine toward medbay around tick 11, which lines up. So Frank is placing himself in medbay with Alice right when she likely died.\n\nAlso, Frank says he saw Bob leave medbay at tick 12, before Alice arrived. That actually makes it harder for Bob to have killed Alice if Alice got there after Bob left.\n\nCharlie/Oxygen is less clear, but Frank also admits he was with Charlie in Oxygen earlier. Combined with the Alice timing, Frank has the strongest opportunity. I\u2019m voting Frank unless something major changes."}}
{"timestamp": 1779478064.639742, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Look, I get why the timeline looks bad on the surface, but you're all skipping a key detail I gave.\n\nEve, you said Alice left upper_engine toward medbay at tick 11. With a 2-tick corridor, she arrives medbay at tick 13 \u2014 that's exactly when I saw her enter. I was *already* in medbay before she got there. And critically: **I saw Bob LEAVE medbay heading to upper_engine at tick 12.** Bob, your own route says you went medbay \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 oxygen. So you admit you were in medbay right before I was.\n\nHere's the problem with the \"Frank killed Alice in medbay\" theory: I left medbay for electrical right after Alice arrived. If I killed her, the body would've been found by the next person through medbay. Who's the next person through medbay area? Nobody has claimed to pass through after tick 13 except... well, no one. Alice's body location hasn't even been confirmed by anyone here \u2014 Bob just *said* she's in medbay. How does Bob know that if he was in oxygen finding Charlie?\n\nAnd on Charlie \u2014 yes, I was in oxygen ticks 3-5. Charlie was alive when I left. Bob ends his route in oxygen and \"finds\" Charlie there. Bob has the body, Bob knows where Alice supposedly is without seeing her \u2014 that's two pieces of info a killer would have.\n\nDiana, Eve, I know the chain looks neat, but Bob is the one placing himself at both death scenes by his own admission. I'm voting Bob."}}
